*.csv
data/
app_backup.R
__pycache__/

# Demo data: TWO sizes, by design (ai_roadmap.md 3.2).
#   demo/hpm_2yr/  small, TRACKED   -> published to the mirror AND in the image,
#                                     so a clone of the showroom can actually
#                                     demonstrate something
#   demo/hpm/      full,  ignored   -> image only, via the !demo/ rule in
#                                     .dockerignore; too large for git
# Built from one source: scripts/make_demo.py --frames N (the full bundle used
# --frames all = 420 monthly periods).
demo/*
!demo/hpm_2yr/
# Re-include the small demo's DATA too. Negating the directory alone is not
# enough: the *.parquet / *.csv rules above still match files inside it, so the
# bundle would commit as five stray .txt sidecars with no data — a demo that
# silently demonstrates nothing.
!demo/hpm_2yr/**
